    "title": "otosora v0.8.4",
    "notes": "# Otosora 0.8.4\n\n## Lyrics\n- No more scrambled letters for a moment when a line lights up. The highlight used to pass through a font weight Otosora doesn't ship, so a stand-in font showed for a few frames.\n- Long lines wrap in full instead of being cut off with \"…\", and the line being sung stays in the middle.\n- Scroll the lyrics yourself and they stay where you put them for a few seconds before following the song again.\n- Lines light up a touch earlier, closer to when you hear them.\n- Timing buttons under the lyrics shift them half a second sooner or later for this song, for videos with a long intro. Double-click the number to reset.\n- Lyrics from a different cut of the song (more than 8 seconds longer or shorter) are no longer used, so they don't run ahead.\n- Better matches for streamed songs: channel names like \"Artist - Topic\" or \"Artist Ch. …\" are cleaned before searching.\n- Songs without lyrics are looked up again after a week, and a stuck connection gives up after 15 seconds instead of loading forever.\n- An instrumental gap shows ♪.\n",
    "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T18:29:28Z",
